msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4D86017F_B013_4F66_BD12_D22AB6461A83"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In addition, he also attended a private school run by an eminent marquis."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 외에도 명망 높은 백작이 연 ⟪k:1⟫사설학교에 다니기도 했습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_3629F78E_BB81_4A87_9AF6_8F56F47D1E54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a5565431a93d423fa1206789cf52287055fbd30203425af1adf46d741bc91d3
