msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3629F78E_BB81_4A87_9AF6_8F56F47D1E54"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though it was not a “school” where students had desks and sat in rows."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사설학교라 해도 ⟪k:1⟫많은 학생이 책상 앞에 앉는 그런 건 아니랍니다."

#: scenario:scenario_308259E9_7A8C_4722_8D2D_68CCB2BB2E78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26d966b5ec32ad3b1955183b38df8e4d33dc1255fc60b71c5418d39fd57324dc
