msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They studied at the marquis’s estate. ⟪k:1⟫Secondary and higher education was not the same "
"as it is today."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫수업 시간은 백작 저택에서 가졌지요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫학교와 ⟪k:3⟫대학 모두 ⟪k:4⟫현대처럼 구체적이진 "
"않았거든요."

#: scenario:scenario_46D19CAC_13AA_4EBA_AE9C_DC3EE2DE449C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87a140ac7ee5de7a4666fde8b50b9ec1426034bb975e855c4772ef3952252a5e
