msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6FFB82DB_D766_4D81_9654_FD543F861B72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The priest wanted to recruit him to the Church, but Mell was having difficulty deciding what "
"he should do."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫신부는 멜을 교회로 빼돌리고 싶나 보지만, ⟪k:1⟫멜 본인은 ⟪k:2⟫자기 진로를 아직 못 정했지요."

#: scenario:scenario_448225CC_F4D1_4024_B523_14E47F0B009B
