msgctxt "scenario:scenario_448225CC_F4D1_4024_B523_14E47F0B009B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That he had such a choice is envious, is it not?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫선택지가 있단 건 ⟪k:1⟫복받은 처지 같지 않으신지요?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫안 그런가요……?"

