msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I beg yer pardon.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Cannae seem t’ get me head outta the past.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Yer "
"order’s right here, sir."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이거 죄송합니다. ⟪k:3⟫아직 예전 그대로 같아서요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫주문하신 건 여기, 완성했"
"습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_5240F9EC_BD1E_4B14_9CC1_E09C4B90FF54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bb1e1b88d18c2fcdb85d9cea5cda53dfa61f39b544a1b1cd4a7af5733767e60
