msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell had stopped at a jewelry store in the center of town on his way back from the church."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫멜이 교회에서 나와 ⟪k:1⟫들른 곳은 ⟪k:2⟫시가지 중심에 가게를 차린 보석상이었습니다."

