msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a matter of fact, the wooden sign out front was engraved with a replica of a piece of his "
"jewelry said to be on display in the palace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫가게 간판도 ⟪k:1⟫왕실에 납품했다는 주인장의 독자 세공 디자인을 ⟪k:2⟫나무로 재현한 것이었습니"
"다."

#: scenario:scenario_4EBF98CD_EA39_406E_87FD_3E3914E83901
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 356e6b76bcaae88fb9ee52ec554e854390147d41f301f4115fba6b58b59bd12e
